"Dust DDS uProtocol Streamer role process\n\nUsage: dds_client [OPTIONS]\n\nOptions:\n      --workload-plan <WORKLOAD_PLAN>\n          Controller-provisioned sustained workload; uses this role's normal binding configuration\n      --domain-id <DOMAIN_ID>\n          DDS domain used for discovery and RTPS traffic [default: 80]\n      --origin-id <ORIGIN_ID>\n          Unique local transport identity used for self-origin suppression\n      --reliability <RELIABILITY>\n          DDS reliability policy [default: reliable] [possible values: reliable, best-effort]\n      --history-depth <HISTORY_DEPTH>\n          DDS KEEP_LAST history depth [default: 32]\n      --route-family <ROUTE_FAMILY>\n          DDS carriage family [default: classic] [possible values: classic, owned-frame, encoded-owned]\n      --encoding <ENCODING>\n          Selected payload/metadata encoding [default: protobuf] [possible values: native, protobuf, xcdrv2, arrow, omgidl]\n      --local-authority <LOCAL_AUTHORITY>\n          Authority of this role [default: authority-a]\n      --peer-authority <PEER_AUTHORITY>\n          Authority of the peer role [default: authority-b]\n      --topic-resource-id <TOPIC_RESOURCE_ID>\n          Publish or notification resource ID [default: 32769]\n      --method-resource-id <METHOD_RESOURCE_ID>\n          RPC method resource ID [default: 4096]\n      --payload <PAYLOAD>\n          UTF-8 payload sent by active roles and echoed by servers [default: dds-role-payload]\n      --timeout-ms <TIMEOUT_MS>\n          Receive and discovery timeout [default: 8000]\n  -h, --help\n          Print help\n  -V, --version\n          Print version\n"
